# The TUI: the pad, its input modes and profiles; a profile switch; the help.
Output tui.webm
Source settings.tape

Type "gamepadii"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Tab
Sleep 800ms
Down
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Tab
Sleep 800ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 900ms
Type "?"
Sleep 2.5s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
